  "description": "No Yeong-ung joined the the new expansion team Knights after a tryout. His dream of becoming a professional baseball player was coming true. However, what awaited him was the cold reality of limited playing time. As he changed positions and sat on the bench, his skills deteriorated compared to his student days. His fellow players are better and sharper, the star manager only cares about himself… \n\nStuck in a situation where it feels like insurmountable obstacles are blocking his way, will No Yeong-ung be able to survive and become a star? \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
